The files in data/ and results/ contain questions, answers and derived material
from RuBQ 2.0 (Rybin, Korablinov, Efimov, Braslavski, ESWC 2021,
https://github.com/vladislavneon/RuBQ), together with model outputs generated
for this study. They are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Changes: a 300-question sample of RuBQ 2.0 test with Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct
generations, matching verdicts and summary metrics.
